<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan forces have compelled Haftar militia members to surrender at a strategic airbase while continuing artillery attacks on Haftar posts. Turkish officials have publicly welcomed a motion supporting Libyan troops, indicating external political backing. China is re-engaging in Libya with military forces tied to recent business agreements, adding a new foreign military dimension. The United Nations has introduced laws criminalising child conscription and raising the recruitment age to 18. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPb3dacGtUWE9tdUc3eUZZTG1NYTNKcUpUdzdmWE83ZW1iVHFhY2xTQ3dGb0dlZlNyX1VrdzBQcXhraXoxLWVhNS1YMUhCdzZFYmRtMjZJMGx4YlZEQVNCaXJhNWVYdTJQcGpfRWY5QS01QkhldXFxNEJSU0puNnFIb25LcHU0SEFVaGthZ09hLS1rVDFVOFNLM2pKTVZUREZoV3Y2bVE2Vk02MDlIUkpz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPdXNpb1FNTDJnZ1ZxWVlmZXRwd1R6UWlrM3Jaek1tWG02WGRhWlFTR1dxLW1lRWtWQVNJcXJBQTlhdm1vdmtaRmVvZDFjVk1ISFhjSURoMTBUMDZ1U1JOaVJ6V0FoSEFUOUdXVHFBbjRNVGtLSUV5aWdUejVlaVV3T2l5aW4xU2FuTGxvZUJxdV9ZaFI1ckJZUVBzZmJ1X0tJbHM0WlFfWi1JU194cnU4YVZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;libyaupdate.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQYnlmemh2ZDVCTU5jSENPS3Z5UFAxc2NxVW4weVpldFJMVnpFbzMxYjlIWjItRHBaSzU2eW1Dd3YwM041eTdJVjQ2YTVpd3p4X3RFV2xiYVZZVEFsODB3T0xNVm4xZ2s3QWJDWHVSMmxqMmIwSl8wdUhBOG0yNWhSLWpEN3BjWWNHRDYwNnVPa3Ezb0hGVmZEM3dTQXg3THNLcWRwaWRqLXNEQXJhekltZ3h4MzZtUU1QeWNjbU5B?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQTV9QUExHNVRIdWFBRW5nd2I4TGRrODMyR2lCbmFl